    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 137 of the laws of 1877 relating to incorporating the library and reading room of the village of Port Chester in Westchester county, in relation to a free association library",
    "basePrintNo": "S4130",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4130-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
